<SiteLayout title="About Minhaj — Independent Product Engineer" description="Meet Minhaj Nadeem, an independent product engineer with eight-plus years in Android and Flutter and experience delivering connected platforms."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About Minhaj</span><h1>A mobile foundation.<br/>A whole-product perspective.</h1><p class="lead">Independent Product Engineer, with eight-plus years of hands-on mobile development and experience delivering connected software from planning to launch.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><ProfilePhoto /><div><h2>I care about how<br/>the product works.</h2><p>My journey began with native Android and Java, then expanded into Kotlin, modern Android architecture, and Flutter. That foundation taught me to build for performance, maintainability, and real users.</p><p>I’ve worked with startups, international remote teams, and product companies across Dubai and Germany, collaborating with founders and leadership on technical decisions.</p><p>SDrive represents the next step in that journey: independently delivering rider and driver apps alongside a marketing website, administration portal, backend, and cloud deployment.</p><p>My approach connects engineering decisions with business workflows—so the product is built for its first launch and the work that comes after.</p><a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/sdrive">Explore the SDrive delivery →</a></div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Delivery capabilities</span><h2>The pieces that make<br/>a product work together.</h2></div><div class="grid"><article><h3>Customer applications</h3><p class="muted">Flutter and native Android, built around customer and provider journeys.</p></article><article><h3>Web and backend systems</h3><p class="muted">Marketing websites, administration interfaces, APIs, data, authentication, and business logic.</p></article><article><h3>Launch and delivery</h3><p class="muted">Requirements, milestones, testing, cloud deployment, releases, and maintenance.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Technical foundation</span><h2>Depth behind the broader offer.</h2><div class="grid">{skillCategories.map(c=><article class="card"><h3>{c.category}</h3>{c.items.map(i=><span class="tag">{i}</span>)}</article>)}</div><div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/files/Minhaj-Nadeem-Resume-12-2025.pdf" download>Download resume · December 2025 ↓</a></div></div></section><ProjectInvitation /></SiteLayout>
